    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah changed."
    },
    {
        "text": "The first time I met her, the feeling she gave me was just like that of Her Majesty, Theresa."
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Her Majesty has always been tragic, burdened... and she knew more about the secrets of this land."
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah is different. She is wrathful, but just calm enough. Still, a zealous anger burns within her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Though they were different in many small ways, they had the same kind of strength. Or, maybe people like them are similar in many ways regardless of their strength."
    },
    {
        "text": "This anger gave rise to Reunion, which attracted countless followers."
    },
    {
        "text": "But soon... she changed."
    },
    {
        "text": "Our daily work has turned into incitement. Provocation. Destruction."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is no longer a revolution for the masses of Infected\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014but rather the same kind of over-engineered, conspiratorial war that we have seen in Kazdel, time and time again."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
