        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "She hasn't caught up yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...If we really run into her head-on, there's going to be trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "You shouldn't use your Arts on Talulah. This isn't the first time either. We must always be careful of what we see."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...Something must have happened to Talulah. We have to tell W."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "We've got a lot of heavies suspicious of us thanks to W's little plans. Do you want to make things even worse?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "What exactly did you see?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "The old Talulah was just a rebel. She freed the Infected and gave them an opportunity to fight back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "But now? There's no effort made to curb their base desires. There is only mindless destruction and killing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "That doesn't prove anything. That's how the other races have always treated the Infected. They're not like Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...You don't understand."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "The behavior by itself isn't a big deal, but I'm talking about the consequences..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Talulah... She's sabotaging Reunion, on purpose."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Don't you think this situation feels familiar?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "She is an excellent leader who can rally ordinary Infected into battle, and win."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "But she's the only one who could dismantle the very tower she built, piece by piece, totally undetected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "I could even say..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Talulah herself is just a slightly fancier brick, something that can be crushed at any time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Are you saying that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "It's just like three years ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "But he... he might've always been like that. He did it all without hesitation... He was just good at hiding it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Talulah isn't like that. Her change was too sudden."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Her shadow... It's as if there are two shadows, but I see no traces of Arts. It's more like..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "A set of ruins. Ancient and imposing, still full of lingering power."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "The nature of your Arts is very special. But your feelings are too vague this time, and I can't base my decisions on vague feelings."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "But W needs to know!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Quiet, we've already been noticed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Anything we do can be used against someone else. You understand this, yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Do you think we can survive a second Babel incident?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "I'm not sure..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...I know W can't."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "I'll go find her. Garcin is dead, so she should be the new leader."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Wait! If Talulah really has her eyes on us already, if you do this\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "I can't wait any longer. Don't give me orders, we're still the same rank."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...Hmph."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "I say that, but this is the first time I've disobeyed your orders."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "You shouldn't always overthink things, Hoederer."
    },
