    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "(W should be right ahead. Once I cross this alley...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "(Isn't that the base camp? What is she doing?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "(Anyway, I need to hurry up...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...Who are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Infected...? What do you want with me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier",
        "text": "Watch your tone, devil."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier",
        "text": "First, a few mercenary teams defected. Then, enemies started showing up in the city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier",
        "text": "Your bunch has made too many mistakes. Did you really think our leader hasn't noticed?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Out of my way. I don't have to listen to your whining."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier",
        "text": "You have to answer to Talulah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...I know. After I report to W, I will then report to Talulah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier",
        "text": "There's no need for that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier",
        "text": "That's not the kind of 'answer' we need."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "What..."
    },
